 "text": "Morrill County Taxes - Morrill County Nebraska - Bridgeport, Ne 69336\nHome\nGovernment Commissioners\nBoard of Equalization\nDepartments Assessor\nCounty Clerk / Register of Deeds\nTreasurer\nCounty Attorney\nCounty Court\nDistrict Court\nElection\nSheriff\nVeteran's Services\nZoning\nRoad\nExtension Office\nServices Handyman\nPublic Transit\nAgenda\nInformational Links\nBoard Minutes\n​​Morrill County Nebraska\nProposed Surplus Personal Property Process\nNebraska Assessors Online\nMorrill County Surplus Disposal Form\nMorrill County Property Search\nMorrill County GIS Map\nMorrill County Assessor\nJohn O. Erickson\n​P.O. Box 868\nBridgeport, NE 69336\nPhone: 308-262-1534\nFax: 308-262-1469\nE-mail: jerickson@morrillcountyne.gov\nThe County Assessor has the duty to value all real and personal property in the county as a basis for the county board to levy taxes. The Assessor must be certified by the Nebraska Department of Property Assessment and Taxation in order to hold office.\n​\nCopyright © Morrill County Nebraska. All Rights Reserved.\nView on Mobile",
